877	    Examples:
878	    - Enumerate web vulns: host='example.com', port=80
879	    - HTTPS enumeration: host='example.com', port=443
880	    - SSH enumeration: host='192.168.1.1', port=22
881	    - Custom service: host='target.com', port=8080
