## 1. Main Python Files

The codebase is organized around a `src/red_team_mcp/` package plus a couple of agent scripts:

| File | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `src/red_team_mcp/fastmcp_server.py` | **Main MCP server entry point.** Defines the FastMCP app, registers all tools, and runs the server. |
| `src/red_team_mcp/database.py` | MongoDB database layer -- scan storage, findings search, exploit database management. |
| `src/red_team_mcp/masscan_scanner.py` | masscan integration with streaming output and banner grabbing. |
| `src/red_team_mcp/nuclei_scanner.py` | Nuclei vulnerability scanner integration with async streaming. |
| `src/red_team_mcp/metasploit_scanner.py` | Metasploit RPC integration for exploit search and execution. |
| `src/red_team_mcp/domain_discovery.py` | Subdomain enumeration via `subfinder` with IP resolution. |
| `src/red_team_mcp/bannerGrabber.py` | Service banner grabbing (HTTP/HTTPS and raw socket) with regex-based service/version identification. |
| `src/red_team_mcp/scanner.py` | OOP-style Scanner class wrapping masscan with config validation, async task management. |
| `src/red_team_mcp/config.py` | Pydantic-based configuration models (`RedTeamMCPConfig`, `ScannerConfig`, `SecurityConfig`) with env var and JSON file loading. |
| `src/red_team_mcp/models.py` | Pydantic data models: `ScanTarget`, `ScanRequest`, `ScanResult`, `HostResult`, `PortResult`, etc. |
| `src/red_team_mcp/constants.py` | Port-to-service mappings (port lists by category and `ports_by_service()` function). |
| `src/red_team_mcp/populate_exploits.py` | Script to populate MongoDB with all Metasploit exploits (parallel processing). |
| `src/red_team_mcp/agent.py` | A stub/placeholder interactive agent (mostly commented-out code). |
| `src/agents/simple_agent.py` | Full interactive CLI red-team agent using Agno + Ollama + MCP tools. |
| `src/agents/hacking_agent.py` | Specialized penetration-testing agent that follows a methodology (recon -> exploit -> post-exploit). |

