| `REDTEAM_MAX_TARGETS` | Max targets per scan |
| `REDTEAM_TIMEOUT` | Scan timeout in seconds |
| `REDTEAM_LOG_LEVEL` | Log level (DEBUG/INFO/WARNING/ERROR/CRITICAL) |
| `REDTEAM_LOG_FILE` | Log file path |
| `REDTEAM_AUTH_TOKEN` | Authentication token (enables auth when set) |
| `REDTEAM_RATE_LIMIT` | Rate limit per minute |
| `REDTEAM_DATA_DIR` | Data directory for results (default: `~/.red-team-mcp`) |
| `OLLAMA_HOST` | Ollama host URL (used by agents, default: `http://localhost:11434`) |

